window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Finally, I had a fresh start. I knew no one. I could be anyone, or so I thought.</p> <p>I wanted to be invisible, to blend into the background. But it turned out keeping my secret wasn’t as easy as I thought it would be.</p> <p>Enter Grayson Mills.</p> <p>When Grayson noticed me, so did everyone else. He wanted me - bad.</p> <p>And what Grayson wanted, he usually got.</p>"; 
